{"tier":"glm-5.2","verse":1,"ref":"hosea 10:1","book":"hosea","lang":"de","chapter":10,"translation":"Ein entblätterter Weinstock ist Jisra'el, Frucht gleicht er sich selbst zu; je mehr seine Frucht sich mehrte, desto mehr mehrte er die Altäre; je besser es seinem Land erging, desto schöner machten sie ⟨die⟩ Mazewot.","tokens":[{"surface":"גפן","gloss":"Weinstock"},{"surface":"בוקק","gloss":"entblätterter"},{"surface":"ישראל","gloss":"Jisra'el"},{"surface":"פרי","gloss":"Frucht"},{"surface":"ישוה","gloss":"gleicht er zu"},{"surface":"לו","gloss":"sich selbst"},{"surface":"כרב","gloss":"je mehr"},{"surface":"לפריו","gloss":"seine Frucht"},{"surface":"הרבה","gloss":"mehrte er"},{"surface":"למזבחות","gloss":"die Altäre"},{"surface":"כטוב","gloss":"je besser"},{"surface":"לארצו","gloss":"seinem Land"},{"surface":"היטיבו","gloss":"machten schön"},{"surface":"מצבות","gloss":"Mazewot"}],"timestamp":"2026-08-06T06:30:05.233026622Z","model":"glm-5.2"}